      "content": "It sounds like you're carrying an immense weight, and that feeling of being hollowed out is exhausting. Don't try to fix this feeling with another forced sunrise; just let the silence be a little kinder to you right now. A small, deliberate act of release, even just a few deep breaths, can be a tiny step toward finding that quiet you deserve.",
